msgctxt "STRINGS.NATURALBACKWALLS.OPTIONS.FEATURE_BACKWALLS.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Worldgen carves feature rooms (caves, lakes, geodes) into a biome after claiming their cells, and the game's own backwall pass skips claimed cells, so those rooms would stay bare. On, they get backwalls from the same noise as the rest of the biome."
msgstr ""

